        IF `the person by way of business provides facilities for gambling within the meaning of section 5 of the Gambling Act 2005` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "a “provider of gambling services” means a person who by way of business provides facilities for gambling"

-- reg 16(6).  The Treasury and the Home Office must prepare a joint report setting out, as appropriate, the findings of the risk
